---

<section class="newsletter section">
  <div class="container newsletter-inner">
    <h2 class="newsletter-title">Quer dica nova de Urubici antes de todo mundo?</h2>
    <p class="newsletter-desc">
      Mandamos roteiro, cachoeira escondida e alerta de friozinho direto no
      seu e-mail. Sem spam, só Serra Catarinense.
    </p>

    <!--
      PLACEHOLDER: ainda sem backend de newsletter integrado.
      `action`/`method` abaixo sao so pra nao quebrar visualmente o form;
      troque pelo endpoint real (ex: Resend/Mailchimp/ConvertKit) quando
      o Jurandir ou a integracao escolhida estiver pronta.
    -->
    <form class="newsletter-form" action="#todo-integrar-newsletter" method="post">
      <label for="newsletter-email" class="visually-hidden">Seu e-mail</label>
      <input
        id="newsletter-email"
        name="email"
        type="email"
        required
        placeholder="seuemail@exemplo.com"
        class="newsletter-input"
      />
      <button type="submit" class="btn btn--charcoal newsletter-submit">Quero receber</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .newsletter {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green) 0%, var(--green-dark) 100%);
    color: #fff;
  }

  /* override local: o :focus-visible global usa --charcoal, que sobre esse
     fundo verde escuro cai pra ~1.1:1 (ilegivel). Branco resolve. */
  .newsletter :focus-visible {
    outline-color: #fff;
  }

  .newsletter-inner {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .newsletter-title {
    color: #fff;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .newsletter-desc {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  .newsletter-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .newsletter-input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    border: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }

  .newsletter-input:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid #fff;
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .newsletter-submit {
    width: 100%;
  }

  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .newsletter-form {
      flex-direction: row;
    }

    .newsletter-input {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .newsletter-submit {
      width: auto;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
    }
  }
</style>
